Third-party files in this directory
===================================

The repository's MIT LICENSE at the root does NOT cover the two files below.
They are Springer Nature's, redistributed here unmodified so the paper sources
in this directory build, and they stay under Springer's own terms.

  llncs.cls       The Lecture Notes in Computer Science LaTeX document class.
                  Copyright Springer Nature. Provided by Springer for preparing
                  LNCS submissions and governed by the terms Springer publishes
                  with it, not by this repository's licence.

  splncs04.bst    The matching BibTeX style. Same origin and same terms.

Both are obtainable from Springer's authors' page for LNCS:
https://www.springernature.com/gp/computer-science/lncs/conference-proceedings-guidelines

Everything else in this directory, the paper's own .tex sources, figures and
bibliography, is the FaMAF CVA6 Project's work and is covered by the
repository's MIT LICENSE.
